Subject: Incident near {ADDRESS}

Had a guy go down about 09:02 this morning near {ADDRESS}. Was helping set up a new right-of-way stretch. Some heavy lifting got dropped, hit his leg. On-site first aid called ambulance. They said femur fracture, took him to hospital.

No product leaked. Line wasn't pressurized yet-just construction. Crew said they had flagged the lift zone but the guy stepped in anyway. Still, no spill or anything.

Need to check if lift plan was updated for this section. I've got the crew holding everything till we sort it. Let me know what else you need.

-{NAME}
Area Supervisor, Prairie Midstream Ltd.

